 Use `client.list_all(workspace="default")` to collect every page into a list.
 
+`sandbox.status.configuration_admission` reports the gateway's admission state,
+policy version and hash, configuration and provider-environment revisions, and error.
+It is `None` when the gateway omits the admission record; absence does not mean acceptance.
+`sandbox.status.configuration_activated` separately reports whether the configuration is active.
+`sandbox.status.main_process_instance_id` identifies the current main process and changes
+when it restarts; it is `None` when the gateway omits the identity.
+
 ### Run commands in an existing sandbox
 
 Use `sandbox` to attach by name. Set `delete_on_exit=False` to keep the sandbox after the context exits:
